  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Area- Focused Network Plus Call - The Nahrein Network: New Ancient History Research for Education in Iraq and its Neighbours</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting development of sustainable heritage management and research infrastructure in fragile and affected states to promote education and employment. Benefits local populations and heritage sector in Iraq. Also secondary regional benefits, including Lebanon and Turkey. SDGs 4,8,17</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Global Challenges Research Fund (GCRF) supports cutting-edge research to address challenges faced by developing countries. The fund addresses the UN sustainable development goals. It aims to maximise the impact of research and innovation to improve lives and opportunity in the developing world.</narrative>
  </description>
